### Create Product 1
POST http://localhost:8123/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Laptop Pro",
  "description": "High performance laptop",
  "price": 1200.50,
  "category": "Electronics",
  "tags": ["laptop", "tech"],
  "reviews": [
    { "user": "user1", "rating": 5, "comment": "Great!" },
    { "user": "user2", "rating": 4, "comment": "Good" }
  ]
}

### Create Product 2
POST http://localhost:8123/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Smart Watch",
  "description": "Fitness tracking smart watch",
  "price": 199.99,
  "category": "Electronics",
  "tags": ["watch", "tech"],
  "reviews": [
    { "user": "user3", "rating": 3, "comment": "Okay" }
  ]
}

### Get All Products
GET http://localhost:8123/api/products

### Search Products
GET http://localhost:8123/api/products/search?text=laptop

### Get Category Counts
GET http://localhost:8123/api/products/analytics/category-counts

### Get Average Ratings
GET http://localhost:8123/api/products/analytics/avg-ratings
